[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m---[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Five Axes of Enforcement[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe engine enforces governance along five orthogonal axes:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m| Axis      | CE-*  | Focus                                                 |[m
[32m+[m[32m| --------- | ----- | ----------------------------------------------------- |[m
[32m+[m[32m| Value     | CE-R* | Residual margin, safety buffers, invariant thresholds |[m
