[32m+[m[32m| Procedure | CE-O* | Step order, no skipping, no fusion                    |[m
[32m+[m[32m| Authority | CE-A* | Roles, signatures, non-delegation                     |[m
[32m+[m[32m| Logic     | CE-C* | Global consistency, deadlock, cycle detection         |[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mEach CE-* rule declares:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m* required evidence[m
[32m+[m[32m* evaluation scope[m
[32m+[m[32m* fail-closed behavior[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mAbsence of required evidence is treated as **absence of validity**.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m---[m
